  "description": "<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"148\"><strong data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"148\">Stijlvolle hero-shooter met unieke personages, co-op campaign en tactische multiplayer – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"499\"><em data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"162\">Battleborn</em> biedt een energieke mix van snelle first-person actie en MOBA-achtige elementen. Je kiest uit een brede selectie helden, ieder met compleet eigen vaardigheden, speelstijl en persoonlijkheid. De game combineert een verhalende campaign die je solo of in co-op kunt spelen met diverse competitieve multiplayer-modi vol tactiek en teamplay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"658\">De kleurrijke stijl, humor en variatie in characters maken Battleborn tot een opvallende titel die veel ruimte biedt voor experimenteren en herspeelbaarheid.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"707\">Waarom Battleborn een interessante titel is</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<li data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"768\">🎯 Hero-shooter gameplay met unieke helden en skillsets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"822\">🤝 Verhalende campaign speelbaar solo of in co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"879\">⚔️ Competitieve multiplayer met tactische objectives</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"921\">🧩 RPG-achtige progressie en loadouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"976\">🎨 Kleurrijke, opvallende stijl boordevol karakter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1019\">📦 Wordt standaard met doosje geleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1040\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1071\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1071\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1097\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1135\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soort game</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1163\">Hero-shooter / actiegame</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PlayStation 4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Speelmodus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1243\">Singleplayer, co-op & multiplayer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meegeleverd</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1268\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Doosje</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Staat</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1295\">In Nette Staat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<p da